<title>NETHERLANDS: VIB NINE-MONTH PROFIT DFL 99.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>VIB NINE-MONTH PROFIT DFL 99.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>First nine months 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     2.56 vs   2.69</p>
<p>    Net profit			    99.20 vs 102.0</p>
<p>    Net rental income		  135.8  vs 142.9</p>
<p>    Interest charges		    33.2  vs  38.3</p>
<p>Shareholders equity p.s.(gld)  46.22  vs  43.25</p>
<p>Note - NIB NV is a property investment fund.</p>
</text>
